{
  "name": "CRM · Seguimiento de leads de la clase gratuita",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "parameters": {
        "httpMethod": "POST",
        "path": "crm-eventos",
        "responseMode": "onReceived",
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "a1",
      "name": "Evento del CRM",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.webhook",
      "typeVersion": 2,
      "position": [
        0,
        300
      ],
      "webhookId": "crm-eventos"
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "assignments": {
          "assignments": [
            {
              "id": "c1",
              "name": "crm_url",
              "value": "https://landing-production-4679.up.railway.app",
              "type": "string"
            },
            {
              "id": "c2",
              "name": "remitente",
              "value": "Cripto Fácil <risasazair@gmail.com>",
              "type": "string"
            },
            {
              "id": "c3",
              "name": "enlace_clase",
              "value": "https://chat.whatsapp.com/KA2iqYpGajdCPxItCGSXMH",
              "type": "string"
            },
            {
              "id": "c4",
              "name": "whatsapp_directo",
              "value": "https://wa.me/573235660403",
              "type": "string"
            }
          ]
        },
        "includeOtherFields": true,
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "a2",
      "name": "Configuración",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.set",
      "typeVersion": 3.4,
      "position": [
        220,
        300
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "conditions": {
          "options": {
            "caseSensitive": true,
            "leftValue": "",
            "typeValidation": "strict"
          },
          "conditions": [
            {
              "id": "i1",
              "leftValue": "={{ $json.body.event }}",
              "rightValue": "lead.created",
              "operator": {
                "type": "string",
                "operation": "equals"
              }
            }
          ],
          "combinator": "and"
        },
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "a3",
      "name": "¿Lead nuevo?",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.if",
      "typeVersion": 2,
      "position": [
        440,
        300
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "fromEmail": "={{ $('Configuración').item.json.remitente }}",
        "toEmail": "={{ $('Evento del CRM').item.json.body.lead.email }}",
        "subject": "Tu lugar en la clase gratuita está reservado",
        "emailFormat": "text",
        "text": "=Hola {{ $('Evento del CRM').item.json.body.lead.name.split(' ')[0] }},\n\nGracias por registrarte a la clase gratuita sobre bots MEV y arbitraje.\n\nEntra al grupo para recibir el enlace y los recordatorios:\n{{ $('Configuración').item.json.enlace_clase }}\n\nRecuerda: la clase es educativa y no es asesoría financiera.\n\n¿Dudas? Escríbenos por WhatsApp: {{ $('Configuración').item.json.whatsapp_directo }}\n\nNos vemos en la clase.",
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "a4",
      "name": "Email de bienvenida",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.emailSend",
      "typeVersion": 2.1,
      "position": [
        680,
        200
      ],
      "credentials": {
        "smtp": {
          "id": "",
          "name": "SMTP"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "method": "POST",
        "url": "={{ $('Configuración').item.json.crm_url }}/api/leads/{{ $('Evento del CRM').item.json.body.lead.id }}/activities",
        "authentication": "genericCredentialType",
        "genericAuthType": "httpHeaderAuth",
        "sendBody": true,
        "specifyBody": "json",
        "jsonBody": "{ \"kind\": \"automatizacion\", \"body\": \"n8n envió el email de bienvenida.\" }",
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "a5",
      "name": "Anotar en CRM: bienvenida",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.httpRequest",
      "typeVersion": 4.2,
      "position": [
        900,
        200
      ],
      "credentials": {
        "httpHeaderAuth": {
          "id": "",
          "name": "CRM token"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "amount": 24,
        "unit": "hours"
      },
      "id": "a6",
      "name": "Esperar 24 h",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.wait",
      "typeVersion": 1.1,
      "position": [
        1120,
        200
      ],
      "webhookId": "espera-24h"
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "url": "={{ $('Configuración').item.json.crm_url }}/api/leads/{{ $('Evento del CRM').item.json.body.lead.id }}",
        "authentication": "genericCredentialType",
        "genericAuthType": "httpHeaderAuth",
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "a7",
      "name": "Consultar lead en CRM",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.httpRequest",
      "typeVersion": 4.2,
      "position": [
        1340,
        200
      ],
      "credentials": {
        "httpHeaderAuth": {
          "id": "",
          "name": "CRM token"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "conditions": {
          "options": {
            "caseSensitive": true,
            "leftValue": "",
            "typeValidation": "strict"
          },
          "conditions": [
            {
              "id": "i2",
              "leftValue": "={{ $json.stage }}",
              "rightValue": "nuevo",
              "operator": {
                "type": "string",
                "operation": "equals"
              }
            }
          ],
          "combinator": "and"
        },
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "a8",
      "name": "¿Sigue sin contactar?",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.if",
      "typeVersion": 2,
      "position": [
        1560,
        200
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "fromEmail": "={{ $('Configuración').item.json.remitente }}",
        "toEmail": "={{ $('Consultar lead en CRM').item.json.email }}",
        "subject": "¿Te llegó el acceso a la clase?",
        "emailFormat": "text",
        "text": "=Hola {{ $('Consultar lead en CRM').item.json.name.split(' ')[0] }},\n\nAyer te registraste a la clase gratuita sobre bots MEV y arbitraje y queremos asegurarnos de que tengas el acceso.\n\nEntra aquí: {{ $('Configuración').item.json.enlace_clase }}\n\nSi tienes alguna duda, responde este correo o escríbenos por WhatsApp: {{ $('Configuración').item.json.whatsapp_directo }}",
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "a9",
      "name": "Email recordatorio",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.emailSend",
      "typeVersion": 2.1,
      "position": [
        1780,
        120
      ],
      "credentials": {
        "smtp": {
          "id": "",
          "name": "SMTP"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "method": "POST",
        "url": "={{ $('Configuración').item.json.crm_url }}/api/leads/{{ $('Consultar lead en CRM').item.json.id }}/activities",
        "authentication": "genericCredentialType",
        "genericAuthType": "httpHeaderAuth",
        "sendBody": true,
        "specifyBody": "json",
        "jsonBody": "{ \"kind\": \"automatizacion\", \"body\": \"n8n envió el recordatorio de 24 h (seguía sin contactar).\" }",
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "a10",
      "name": "Anotar en CRM: recordatorio",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.httpRequest",
      "typeVersion": 4.2,
      "position": [
        2000,
        120
      ],
      "credentials": {
        "httpHeaderAuth": {
          "id": "",
          "name": "CRM token"
        }
      }
    }
  ],
  "connections": {
